                        "sense_id": "15a10342-fc1b-3915-bfe3-9ce5c0f87a27",
                        "entry_id": "8c1c30a1-b19f-303e-b9af-b5dbd4d8b077",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An abnormal mass within the uterus; a false conception."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f567fb8-247c-431b-8d75-fb65252f2b32",
                                "sense_id": "15a10342-fc1b-3915-bfe3-9ce5c0f87a27",
                                "text": "Thou art very Trinculo indeed! How camest thou to be the siege of this moon-calf? Can he vent Trinculos?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6bc4af8c-afc1-36ab-9d90-1f0a707f7135",
                        "entry_id": "8c1c30a1-b19f-303e-b9af-b5dbd4d8b077",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A poorly-conceived idea or plan."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be958e4d-3e89-365e-afa1-77244f756659",
                        "entry_id": "8c1c30a1-b19f-303e-b9af-b5dbd4d8b077",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A dreamer, someone absent-minded or distracted; a fool, simpleton."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "703b519f-7f00-437f-8231-62afcada92fc",
                                "sense_id": "be958e4d-3e89-365e-afa1-77244f756659",
                                "text": "“[…] you’re a jobbernowl and a doodle, a maundering mooncalf and a blockheaded numps, a gaby and a loon; you’re a Hatter!” I shrieked the last epithet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea922290-b04e-4312-bf6f-55f6d3085338",
                                "sense_id": "be958e4d-3e89-365e-afa1-77244f756659",
                                "text": "But I can think of no one but a mooncalf or a gaby\nWho would trust their own child to raise a baby."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "002a3b85-b672-4fff-aeb7-1b049a2d2f99",
                                "sense_id": "be958e4d-3e89-365e-afa1-77244f756659",
                                "text": "He slipped it softly onto her unresisting finger and, like the unwise moncalf he was, kissed it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
